{
  "page_id": "RA-29",
  "section_header": "REAR AXLE AND SUSPENSION — IRS Type Differential",
  "title": "ASSEMBLY OF DIFFERENTIAL",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Illustration showing differential case assembly with ring gear",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 3,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 18
      },
      "diagram_id": "RA091"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(i) Check the ring gear runout."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Maximum runout: 0.07 mm (0.0028 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Install the differential case onto the carrier and tighten the adjusting nut just to where there is no play in the bearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "ASSEMBLY OF DIFFERENTIAL"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(See page RA-22)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "step": "1",
          "title": "TEMPORARILY ADJUST DRIVE PINION PRELOAD",
          "substeps": [
            {
              "substep": "(a)",
              "text": "Install the following parts.",
              "list_items": [
                "Drive pinion",
                "Front bearing"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Illustration showing drive pinion and front bearing assembly",
      "labels": [
        "Front Bearing"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 22,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE: Assemble the spacer, oil slinger and oil seal after adjusting the gear contact pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Illustration showing companion flange installation with SST tool",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 40,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 17
      },
      "diagram_id": "RA082"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Install the companion flange with SST."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Coat the threads of the nut with MP grease."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09557-22022"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Illustration showing adjustment of drive pinion preload using SST",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 59,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 17
      },
      "diagram_id": "RA0027"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) Adjust the drive pinion preload by tightening the companion flange nut."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Using SST to hold the flange, tighten the nut."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09330-00021"
    },
    {
      "type": "caution",
      "text": "CAUTION: As there is no spacer, tighten a little at a time, being careful not to overtighten it."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Illustration showing torque wrench measuring preload",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 78,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 16
      },
      "diagram_id": "RA003"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(d) Using a torque wrench, measure the preload."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Preload:"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Bearing Type",
        "Preload"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "New bearing",
          "12 — 19 kg-cm\n(10.4 — 16.5 in.-lb, 1.2 — 1.9 N·m)"
        ],
        [
          "Reused bearing",
          "6 — 10 kg-cm\n(5.2 — 8.7 in.-lb, 0.6 — 1.0 N·m)"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
